Inputs of the refkv kvstore's tests (tests/kvstore/refkv.spec.ts), copied
from refkv's synthetic fixtures (https://github.com/d-v-b/refkv, fixtures/,
MIT OR Apache-2.0): an MP4 file (H.264 and AAC), a TIFF file, a VSI file with
its tile files beside it, a RICE_1 tile-compressed FITS image, and a GRIB2
message with a bitmap (grib_bitmap.grib2, with grib_bitmap.expected.npy, the
values eccodes decodes it to: refkv's fixtures/grib/expected/grib_bitmap.0.npy);
notes.txt is of no supported format.
